            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\n\nAt the moment I don't support the decision to add LuaLS-EmmyLua-LuaCATS annotations to 'mini.nvim'. Mostly because it will add too much boilerplate lines which will duplicate already existing documentation.\n\nSee more details in [this comment](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/issues/1330#issuecomment-2464133383).\n\nClosing as not planned in the near future and not in the form from this issue.",
